@@ -0,0 +1,802 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Cryptography Research, Inc. (CRI).
+ * CMH LKM -- ECDH / X25519 kpp Driver
+ *
+ * Registers "ecdh-nist-p256", "ecdh-nist-p384", and "curve25519"
